        "Content": "<ul><li> Stunning location - sited on an elevated half acre site with panoramic views </li><li> Part of an exclusive enclave of just 11 houses - totally private & not visible form the road </li><li> Generously proportioned with 3 bedrooms - 2 double & 2 bathrooms </li><li> Large lounge with sold fuel stove & door to patio looking onto the best views in Ireland </li><li> Close to the lovely village of Ballyvaughan & the famous Monks restaurant </li><li> Minutes from Bishopsquarter beach & 10 minutes to the Flaggy shore & New Quay </li><li> Located in the heart of the Burren which provides the most stunning dramatic backdrop to the house </li><li> Idyllic peaceful location with the most stunning uninterrupted sea views </li><li> Would make a fabulous owner occupier or indeed a 2nd home by the sea </li><li> Viewing is highly recommended - contact sole agent 091 868080</li></ul>"
